`task-card.md` supports the boundary:
- Lifecycle is `in-progress` and Acceptance is empty.
- `Version increment` is `N/A` and `Release write set` is `N/A`.
- Release boundary is `plan release child of REL-OX-01`, with C/D coverage from `OX-284` and `D-OX-TAG`.
