- **P3:** your request says "every Cargo run" has the linker warning, but `FMT.stderr` is empty. The packet's own records correctly say "all four" test runs, so the packet is right and only the request wording was too broad.
- **Note:** the scaffold excerpt doesn't show a `Default` derive on `FixtureOptions`. The B source compiles and passes, so the derive must exist.
